<table cellpadding="5" width="100%">
	<tr>
		<td class="content_heading1">
			<B>CONGRATULATIONS!!</B><br>
			Your Laplink Internet Account has been created. Please write down your username 
			and password and store it in a safe location.
		</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan="2">
		</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td colspan="3" class="content_text">
			<B>Finish installation of Laplink Internet:</B>
			<OL>
				<LI>On each PC you wish to access, you will need to register that computer to your 
					Laplink Internet Account.
					<BR>
					If your computer has not been registered for Laplink Internet you will be 
					prompted with the following screen;<br><br>
					<img src="x-res/REGSCREEN.JPG"><br><br>
				<LI>Click Yes and you will be brought to a Laplink Internet web page.<br>
				<LI>Select "Click here to assign this PC to your Account"<br>
				<LI>Enter your Laplink Internet username, password and a name that you want to use 
					to access this PC<br>
			</OL>
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
